title: Cloudflare API Usage
agents: cloudflare
catalog: cloud/cloudflare
license: WTFPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the Cloudflare API usage of the special agent.
 It reports the number of API calls made, elapsed time, and any errors
 that occurred during data collection. Errors can be filtered using
 configurable ignore patterns.

discovery:
 One service is created per Cloudflare account.
